    {
      "claim": "管理复杂性的两种根本手段是消除不必要复杂性，以及用模块隐藏不可消除的复杂性。",
      "confidence": "high",
      "derived_image": null,
      "end_seconds": 1175.7,
      "id": "eliminate-or-hide-complexity",
      "planned_quote": "The second approach is where you use modular design where you basically try and hide the complexity.",
      "planned_quote_kind": "transcript",
